                                <title>Introduction</title>
                                <note>Introduction partly similar to <ref type="work" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/LIT3584Intro">Introductive exhortation to the Taʾammǝra Māryām</ref> with a similar set of miracles as
                                    <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/BNFet60#ms_i1.2">Paris, Bibliothèque nationale de France, BnF Éthiopien 60: Taʾammǝra Māryām (in ms_i1.2)</ref>.</note>
                                
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">በስመ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/> ንዌጥን፡ በረድኤተ፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ወበሠናይ፡ ሀብቱ፡ ዐጽሒፈ፡ ተአምሪሃ፡ ለእግዝእትነ፡
                                    ቅድስት፡ ድንግል፡ በ፪ኤ፡<surplus>፡</surplus> ማርያም፡ ወላዲተ፡ አምላክ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/><pb n="83ra"/> ንዑ፡ ንነግረክሙ፡
                                    አኃዊነ፡ ፍቁራን። ውሉደ፡ ቤተ፡ ክርስቲያን፡ እግዚአብሔር፡ ይባርክሙ፡ ወያብርህ፡ አዕይንት፡ አልባቢክሙ፡ <surplus>፡</surplus> ለሰሚዓ፡ ተአምሪሃ፡
                                    ለእግዝእትነ፡ ማርያም፡</incipit>
                            </msItem>
