        potter who was buried alive</title>
                                <note>With an incipit different to the one in <ref type="mss" corresp="https://betamasaheft.eu/EMML2999">Collegeville, Hill Museum and Manuscript Library, MS EMML no. 2999</ref>.</note>
                                <incipit xml:lang="gez">፪ ተአምሪሃ፡ <gap reason="ellipsis"/> ስምዑ፡ አበውየ፡ ወአኃውየ፡ ከመ፡ ንንግርክሙ፡ ዘንተ፡ ተአምረ፡ ዓቢየ።
